{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">黃大仙有麵包店天花混凝土剝落，一名女顧客輕傷送院。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">事發後，麵包店內滿布混凝土，部分有相當厚度。店內假天花被撞至鬆脫，多個鐵框及光管搖搖欲墜。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.FALLING-0930_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026uudLZIeCyT1787883799.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.FALLING-0930_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">麵包店位於雙鳳街華鳳樓的地舖，警方指早上近八時，一塊4米乘3米的混凝土墮下，擊中店內一名20多歲女顧客，她頭及手腳擦傷，清醒送往伊利沙伯醫院治理。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-28T02:39:18.246511+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":145,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}